OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA largely dry day with rather a
OL,6,Flot of cloud but also some bright
OL,7,Fintervals, the best of these towards
OL,8,Fthe Great Glen. A few brief showers
OL,9,Fwill pass through on the light
OL,10,Fwesterly breeze.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FBright intervals and a few
OL,13,Fshowers during the evening. A cloudy
OL,14,Fnight with patchy rain or drizzle but
OL,15,Fbecoming mainly dry towards Inverness
OL,16,Fand Speyside.
OL,17,
OL,18,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day but some
OL,19,Fbright intervals breaking through at
OL,20,Ftimes. There will also be the odd
OL,21,Fpassing light shower.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
