OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith long sunny spells on Monday and
OL,7,Fbecoming a little warmer. Mainly dry
OL,8,Fon Tuesday and Wednesday but perhaps
OL,9,Fsome showers at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
